WHITE_SPACE ' '
TARGET 'log/scheduler-create'
WHITE_SPACE ' '
WORD 'scheduler-create-log'
EOL '\n'
COMMENT '# Armed right before the chain starts (`@from`), so a slow early step (B stopped: the acks wait 30 s and 20 s) cannot use the window up (B25);'
EOL '\n'
COMMENT '# the Lambda runs when chain-schedule does.'
